\ Fixture for own_module_image_scan_serialized, image-serialized via `use`.
\ Exports a `probe` colliding with own_module_image_scan_serialized_b's. Its
\ module name sorts first, so the residual module-cache scan must answer
\ with this export. `a-tag` calls `probe` so the colliding body is
\ reachable from the entry and compiles with this module's identity.

probe: ( -- str ) [ "A-PROBE" ] ;

a-tag: ( -- str ) [ probe ] ;
